# Force LF line endings for all text files in both the stored blob and the
# checkout, regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. See AGENTS.md:
# files under .claude/, SKILL.md, CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md are silently ignored by
# Claude Code when they contain CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly protect known binary assets from any text normalization, rather
# than relying solely on Git's content auto-detection.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
